Error [jet.UnknownType]: An inferred struct literal needs an expected type
  --> tests/ui/brace_group_of_name_value_entries_is_a_record_literal.jet:5:12
    |
  5 |     point: { x: 1, y: 2 }
    |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The `{ ... }` form uses the surrounding type to choose its fields
 Fix: Write the struct name before the braces, like `Point{ x: 1 }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0119
